Residential heating oil in the U.S. averaged $6.138 a gallon in the week of 2026-11-02 (down $0.092 from the week before, $3.632 a year ago). Residential propane in the U.S. averaged $2.820 a gallon in the week of 2026-11-02 (up $0.089 from the week before, $2.445 a year ago). Source: U.S. Energy Information Administration weekly heating oil and propane survey, released 2026-11-04; next release 2026-11-12.

